      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "INC",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A, B, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.125) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate NOT-NAND\u0027 gate. Role in the 2-bit program counter: closes the high bit\u0027s XOR, INC1 = NAND(R, S) = C0 \u2295 C1 \u2014 the high bit toggles exactly when the low bit wraps from 1 back to 0. The whole PC composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction \u2014 there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
